uling and review-board cadence are\n45\texternally controlled and cannot be compressed by engineering effort.\n46\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bd6d5ec5bce34b1","agent_id":"a1c09ab8cd02268e5","session_id":"b908e981-68fd-4e98-a28a-ee0224758c04","uuid":"e5f9d795-caa3-4acf-97b1-d16283d2a5ad","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:18:47.831Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ea73225c3ccc01d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013 into epics"}
